00:32:35.420 --> 00:32:39.500
is a pretty amazing
prospect for me.

00:32:39.500 --> 00:32:46.130
And just in general, the
Pub/Sub paradigm in itself

00:32:46.130 --> 00:32:51.090
is pretty cool once you start
getting into the distributed

00:32:51.090 --> 00:32:55.920
computing side of computing,
which is everything today.

00:32:55.920 --> 00:32:58.360
And in Cloud Pub/Sub,
that's just kind

00:32:58.360 --> 00:33:01.890
of delivered to you on a silver
platter, it just kind of works.

00:33:01.890 --> 00:33:08.770
So I would encourage
game developers

00:33:08.770 --> 00:33:12.030
