apps or website

00:33:15.220 --> 00:33:17.790
apps to think about
how all the data

00:33:17.790 --> 00:33:20.890
from the different endpoints
and the different services

00:33:20.890 --> 00:33:22.300
comes together.

00:33:22.300 --> 00:33:25.110
It's not just plain
networking anymore.

00:33:25.110 --> 00:33:27.402
You've got to have
something a little fancier.

00:33:27.402 --> 00:33:28.360
MARK MANDEL: Excellent.

00:33:28.360 --> 00:33:29.380
And Eric?

00:33:29.380 --> 00:33:32.030
ERIC ANDERSON: Sure,
thanks for having me.

