00:34:38.639 --> 00:34:39.770
how do they discover that?

00:34:39.770 --> 00:34:42.010
How do I understand
when there are

00:34:42.010 --> 00:34:44.170
imperfections in their games?

00:34:44.170 --> 00:34:46.260
And potentially, what's
even more interesting

00:34:46.260 --> 00:34:49.750
is that Kabam Games
